      "content": "look i get the disclaimer but i'm just not looking for an appointment right now. i just want to know if 300mg a day is a reasonable amount for someone with my condition. i'm not trying to do anything crazy, just trying to stop the cramping so i can sleep. if you can't give me a medical prescription, can you at least tell me if that dose is generally considered safe for someone with stage 3 CKD? like is that a huge amount or is it pretty minor?",
